{%- comment -%}
  Vesper legal page — Returns Policy.
  Copy from the Vesper content document (section 24.6).
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'vesper-legal.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{% render 'vesper-page-hero',
   title: 'Returns Policy',
   subtitle: 'Cancellations, returns, refunds and your rights',
   breadcrumb: 'Returns Policy' %}

<section class="v-section v-section--tight v-legal">
  <div class="v-container v-legal__grid">
    <aside class="v-legal__toc">
      <h3 class="v-legal__toc-title">Contents</h3>
      <ul class="v-legal__toc-list">
        <li><a href="#order-cancellations">1. Order Cancellations</a></li>
        <li><a href="#change-of-mind">2. Change of Mind</a></li>
        <li><a href="#return-shipping">3. Return Shipping and Fees</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faulty-items">4. Faulty, Damaged or Incorrect Items</a></li>
        <li><a href="#consumer-law">5. Your Rights under Australian Consumer Law</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how-to-return">6. How to Return a Product</a></li>
        <li><a href="#refunds">7. Refunds</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">8. Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </aside>

    <div class="v-legal__main">
      <div id="order-cancellations" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>1. Order Cancellations</h2>
        <p>
          You can cancel your order before it is dispatched by contacting us at
          <a href="mailto:info@vesperrobot.au">info@vesperrobot.au</a>, and we will refund you in full. If your order
          has already shipped, contact us as soon as possible and we will guide you through the return process.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="change-of-mind" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>2. Change of Mind</h2>
        <p>
          You can request a return or exchange within 30 days of receiving your product. The product must be in its
          original packaging, unused and in the same condition as received, complete with all accessories, manuals and
          components, and free from damage caused by misuse, accidents or unauthorised modification. Proof of purchase
          is required. Products that have been used, damaged or altered, or that are returned without original packaging
          or accessories, may not be eligible.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="return-shipping" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>3. Return Shipping and Fees</h2>
        <p>
          For change-of-mind returns, you pay the return shipping cost, and original shipping charges are generally not
          refunded. For high-value items such as robot mowers, a 15% restocking fee may apply if the original packaging
          has been compromised.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="faulty-items" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>4. Faulty, Damaged or Incorrect Items</h2>
        <p>
          If your product is faulty, damaged on arrival or incorrectly supplied, we will cover the reasonable cost of
          returning it. We will repair, replace, exchange or refund it (in full or in part) in line with our
          <a href="/pages/warranty-policy">Warranty Policy</a> and the Australian Consumer Law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="consumer-law" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>5. Your Rights under Australian Consumer Law</h2>
        <p>
          Our goods come with guarantees that cannot be excluded under the Australian Consumer Law. You are entitled to
          a replacement or refund for a major failure and compensation for any other reasonably foreseeable loss or
          damage. You are also entitled to have the goods repaired or replaced if the goods fail to be of acceptable
          quality and the failure does not amount to a major failure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="how-to-return" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>6. How to Return a Product</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Submit our return and exchange form, or email <a href="mailto:info@vesperrobot.au">info@vesperrobot.au</a> with your order number and reason.</li>
          <li>We review your request within 48 hours. If approved, we send you a return authorisation (RMA) number and instructions.</li>
          <li>Pack the product securely with its original packaging, accessories and manuals. We recommend a tracked service; keep your proof of postage.</li>
          <li>Do not send anything back before we approve your return.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div id="refunds" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>7. Refunds</h2>
        <p>
          After we receive and inspect the product, we process approved refunds within 1–3 business days to your
          original payment method. Depending on your bank or card issuer, it may take up to 7 more business days to
          appear.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="contact" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <div class="v-legal__contact">
          <p><strong>Vesper Robot Mowers Pty. Ltd.</strong></p>
          <p>📍 Address: 3 Read Street, Templestowe VIC 3106</p>
          <p>📧 Email: <a href="mailto:info@vesperrobot.au">info@vesperrobot.au</a></p>
          <p>📞 Phone: +61 448 290 926</p>
          <a class="v-btn v-btn--primary" href="/pages/contact">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

